fixture air_reverse_keeps_momentum
doc BUILD.md s5 Jump "Air control: full acceleration in air, 0 to max in 8 f"; docs/adr/0010 "reversed, normal air control takes over": reversing a dash-jump in the air bleeds its speed at the air rate
room test/flat
spawn 300 544
frames 40
input
  0 R dash
  1..3 R
  4..14 R jump
  15..30 L jump
end
expect
  at 4 event.jump=1
  at 14 vx=5120
  # 288 sub-pixels a frame toward the other way: still moving right, no instant flip.
  at 15 vx=4832 facing=-1
  at 16 vx=4544
end
